{"id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel.md","title":"Bounded GL Countermodel","display":"lem-gl-finite-countermodel — Bounded GL Countermodel","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","aliases":["89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel"],"display":"lem-gl-finite-countermodel — Bounded GL Countermodel","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-gl-finite-countermodel — Bounded GL Countermodel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span> 按原始语法展开后取子公式集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为 GL 定理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}\\)</span> 为传递且逆良基的框架谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}finite\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists M=(W,R,V)\\ \\exists w\\in W\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\\land\n1\\le|W|\\le2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)|}\\land M,w\\not\\models A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}finite\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists M=(W,R,V)\\ \\exists w\\in W\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\\land\n1\\le|W|\\le2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)|}\\land M,w\\not\\models A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 5 章，印刷页 78–84；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n原书第 5 章 Theorem 3 与随后界限。证明采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}(A)\\cup\\{\\neg B:B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(A)\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}(A)\\cup\\{\\neg B:B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(A)\\}\\)</span> 中的一致完备类型，至多每个子公式选一个真假极性，故世界数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}\">\\(2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}\\)</span>。类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 的关系要求：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box B\">\\(\\Box B\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\Box B\">\\(B,\\Box B\\)</span> 都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> 中，且某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box E\">\\(\\Box E\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box E\">\\(\\neg\\Box E\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>。盒公式严格增加，给出传递、非自反性。盒反例的见证类型由 Löb 公理保证一致；对子公式归纳得到真值引理。此严格增加条件不可被普通 K 过滤关系替代。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}gl\\text{-}finite\\text{-}countermodel}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathrm{GL}\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists M=(W,R,V)\\ \\exists w\\in W\\\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{GLFrame}((W,R))\\land\n1\\le|W|\\le2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}_{\\Box}(A)|}\\land M,w\\not\\models A\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}(A)\\cup\\{\\neg B:B\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box B","display":false},{"tex":"B,\\Box B","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box E","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box E","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1631,"backlinks":[{"id":"cf7dbabb97c0679f","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Boolos，第 5 章 pp.78–84；本条给出一般 FMP 接口，GL 的具体界见 [[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]。"},{"id":"3bbdf6f3419b5805","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"251691cede4cbc3e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c2347bd841306e40","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a0b83ca065132609","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c0adaf80b9cae9e6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84538a9442ddea2d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4ba460c900107e00","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f0380129bd9e48f3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ee8821b1cefc81b2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7a04766d8c28cddc","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"be68cce492414c6b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"起点：[[89-df-modal-formula]] → [[89-df-gl-logic]] → [[89-df-gl-frame]] → [[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]] → [[89-thm-solovay-theorem]]。"}],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","c6ab46cd662b1409","71b4f56d6213ff7c","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}